<title>INDIA: India's IDBI 1996/97 net seen higher.</title>
<headline>India's IDBI 1996/97 net seen higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Term lending institution Industrial Development Bank of India (IDBI) will see its net profit rising 9.93 percent to 11.07 billion rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, according to a Reuter poll.</p>
<p>Analysts at 28 leading securities and brokerage firms projected a low of 10.14 billion rupees and high of 12.77 billion rupees against 10.07 billion rupees in 1995/96.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>IDBI  ----PAT seen up 9.93%, sales 15.66%</p>
<p>			Net profit  1995/96   Net income    1995/96</p>
<p>				 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>Average	     11,069.66  10,070.00   56,108.63   48,510.00</p>
<p>High		  12,766.00		  62,820.00</p>
<p>Low		   10,140.00		  54,593.00</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
